   "effects": [
    {
     "type": "iron_diagnosis",
     "range_ft": 30,
     "applies_to": "self",
     "evidence": "As an Action, study one creature within 30 feet that you can perceive. Make a Wisdom (Medicine), Intelligence (Investigation), or Cultivation Check against the creature’s Cultivation Save DC. Success: Learn two of the following. Until the end of your next turn, your first Unarmed Strike against that creature has Advantage."
    }
   ],
   "riders": [
    "Resistance is answered from effective defenses with their damage types and source qualifications. Immunity to Prone, Grappled and Stunned is answered from effective condition defenses. Ongoing bodily or martial enhancements need reviewed source classification. Unknown facts remain GM decisions; immunity to a condition does not establish immunity to being pushed or pulled, which needs separate GM adjudication.",
    "Perception through unrepresented senses (such as hearing a concealed creature) remains GM adjudication; represented sight, Blindsight, Spiritual Sense and pinpointing senses run."
   ],
